# CODEOWNERS — Spec-First SDLC
#
# Agent configuration is code. The files that steer agents (AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md,
# REVIEW.md, the .claude/ hooks and subagents), the decision record, and the
# enforcement config change only through a PR that a named code owner approves.
#
# Replace @OWNER with a real GitHub user or team. Enable "Require review from Code
# Owners" in branch protection so these paths cannot merge without that approval.

# Default ownership covers application changes as well as workflow configuration.
# Autonomous routine integration requires a separate trusted evidence gate; do not
# simply remove human review requirements without installing that replacement.
*                   @OWNER
AGENTS.md           @OWNER
CLAUDE.md           @OWNER
REVIEW.md           @OWNER
/.claude/           @OWNER
/docs/decisions/    @OWNER
/.github/           @OWNER
/.agents/           @OWNER
/.codex/            @OWNER
/.pi/               @OWNER
/.opencode/         @OWNER
/.sdlc/             @OWNER
/scripts/sdlc/      @OWNER
/scripts/check-changelog.mjs @OWNER
/docs/changes/      @OWNER
